<html><head><title>Teambuilding</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><img id="imagen" src="6_Information_files/basecamp01.jpg" width="90%" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="display: none;">                                                                    <h3 style="margin-top:0cm"><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Team building</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">, or community formation, lies at the heart of transdisciplinary work. The following pages in the base camp will tell you more about the different dimensions of collaboration in a transdisciplinary environment.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Let’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> start with the basics. Team building is essential in two areas of transdisciplinary projects:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Within your project group</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">From your project outward, toward as many relevant stakeholders as possible</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Starting with your own group: </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ve</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">likely experienced</span><span style="margin: 0px"> that collaboration is an </span><span style="margin: 0px">art in itself</span><span style="margin: 0px">. In this TRAIL, we return to this topic often. Working together in a transdisciplinary team is especially complex due to the diversity of team members — differences that must </span><span style="margin: 0px">ultimately be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> merged into innovative knowledge.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Secondly, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important to begin building social relationships with the </span></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">field</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> surrounding the societal issue from the very start. This field helps you better understand the challenge and </span><span style="margin: 0px">come up with</span><span style="margin: 0px"> solutions. Expanding your network also helps you find the right new people to join the project team.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">In transdisciplinary work, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> crucial to stay alert to missing participants and perspectives. When you take on a coordinating role, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> up to you and your team to decide how to involve stakeholders in the project: as advisors, sparring partners, local guides, or researchers.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Under the </span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Theory</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> section, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ll</span><span style="margin: 0px"> find insights from scientific research on team building and the motivations of participants to engage in multi-, inter-, or transdisciplinary collaborations.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">The </span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Practice</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> page will soon offer tools and approaches you can use to foster group formation.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Note:</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> In-depth pages for theory and practice are not yet fully available on this topic. Some authors of the TRAIL tool are currently working on a review study of transdisciplinary collaborations. Knowledge from this study will be added here soon.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">You can already check out an introduction to this new research and the researchers here:</span><a href="https://www.avans.nl/onderzoek/projecten/detail/scoping-review-transdisciplinaire-samenwerkingen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Scoping review transdisciplinaire samenwerkingen | Avans Hogeschool</span></span></a><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Sign up for the TRAIL newsletter</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> to stay informed about content updates.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></h3>                                                                      </body></html>